></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{edge}=0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{tier}=0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span> 时，源站收到的请求约为总流量的 4.5%，回源连接数下降一个数量级。这就是分层缓存（tiered cache）的工程价值——它不是把内容存两遍，而是把「谁有权访问源站」收敛到一个窄口径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[终端用户] --&gt; L[下层缓存&lt;br/&gt;就近 PoP]&#10;    L --&gt;|命中| U&#10;    L --&gt;|未命中| T[上层缓存 / 区域层&lt;br/&gt;只有它能回源]&#10;    T --&gt;|命中| L&#10;    T --&gt;|未命中| S[Origin Shield&lt;br/&gt;回源收敛点]&#10;    S --&gt;|请求折叠| O[源站 / 对象存储]&#10;    O --&gt; S&#10;    L -.-&gt;|强一致状态| D[(边缘 KV / Durable Object)]&#10;    D -.-&gt; L\">graph TD\n    U[终端用户] --&gt; L[下层缓存&lt;br/&gt;就近 PoP]\n    L --&gt;|命中| U\n    L --&gt;|未命中| T[上层缓存 / 区域层&lt;br/&gt;只有它能回源]\n    T --&gt;|命中| L\n    T --&gt;|未命中| S[Origin Shield&lt;br/&gt;回源收敛点]\n    S --&gt;|请求折叠| O[源站 / 对象存储]\n    O --&gt; S\n    L -.-&gt;|强一致状态| D[(边缘 KV / Durable Object)]\n    D -.-&gt; L</pre><p>缓存与状态是两类不同的存储职责，混在一张表里设计会同时牺牲命中率和一致性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>状态层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>源站内容的副本</td>\n<td>边缘自身写入的权威数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性要求</td>\n<td>允许短暂陈旧（秒到小时）</td>\n<td>购物车/库存需强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效方式</td>\n<td>TTL、purge、revalidate</td>\n<td>事务写、版本号、CAS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要指标</td>\n<td>命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>、回源率</td>\n<td>写延迟、读写一致性延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型实现</td>\n<td>分层 HTTP 缓存、CDN edge cache</td>\n<td>Workers KV、Durable Objects</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层缓存拓扑与回源收敛\">分层缓存拓扑与回源收敛</h2><p>分层缓存把缓存节点分成「下层的就近层」和「上层的聚集层」。Cloudflare 的 Tiered Cache 文档描述得很直接：就近的数据中心先响应访客，未命中时向下层之上的 upper tier 查询，而 <strong>&quot;only the upper-tier can ask the origin&quot;</strong>——只有上层有权访问源站。上层同样未命中时才回源，并沿层级把内容回填。这套结构减少了接触源站的数据中心数量，集中了源站连接，从而降低带宽与源站负载（来源：developers.cloudflare.com/cache/how-to/tiered-cache/）。其 Smart Tiered Cache 会自动为每个源站挑选「最近的上层」，无需手工配置。</p>\n<p>AWS CloudFront 的 Origin Shield 是同一思路的单层特化：它在区域边缘缓存（regional edge cache）与源站之间再加一层，<strong>所有缓存层的请求都必须经过 Origin Shield</strong> 才能到达源站。官方文档强调——对同一个未命中对象，Origin Shield 会把并发请求折叠（consolidate），<strong>&quot;resulting in as few as one request going to your origin&quot;</strong>（来源：docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/origin-shield.html）。请求折叠是分层缓存在高并发下真正防止缓存击穿（cache stampede）的机制：没有这一层，N 个 PoP 同时未命中就会向源站打出 N 个并发请求。</p>\n<p>工程上有三个必须记住的细节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同区域旁路</strong>。CloudFront 说明，与源站处于同一区域的请求会绕过 Origin Shield，收敛效果依赖源站与用户的地理分布。</li>\n<li><strong>计费口径</strong>。Origin Shield 对 <code>PUT/POST/PATCH/DELETE</code> 始终是增量层；对 <code>GET/HEAD</code>，<strong>TTL 小于 3600 秒的请求被视为动态请求</strong>并单独计费（来源同上）。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性</strong>。从 Shield 命中的请求在 CloudFront 日志里记为 <code>x-edge-detailed-result-type: OriginShieldHit</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上层节点的选择通常用一致性哈希映射源站或对象键，避免某个上层成为热点，也保证同一对象在拓扑变动后仍大概率落到同一上层。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>分层缓存收敛的是「未命中流量如何回到源站」；节点之间靠什么网络把回填内容传回来，属于网络平面的职责，见同 hub 的《<a href=\"../1_edge-platform-architecture/3_edge-network-dataplane-backhaul.md\"></a>边缘网络平面、流量调度与回源互联》。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"缓存键-变体与失效策略\">缓存键、变体与失效策略</h2><p>命中率不仅取决于拓扑，更取决于缓存键是否稳定。HTTP 缓存的基础键由请求方法与 URL 构成，<code>Vary</code> 响应头则把「方法 + URL」之外的请求头纳入变体维度：<code>Vary: Accept-Encoding, Accept-Language</code> 意味着每个不同的 <code>Accept-Encoding</code>/<code>Accept-Language</code> 组合都会生成一份独立缓存副本（来源：MDN <code>Vary</code>，developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Vary）。由此有两条影响命中率的规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>只用真正会改变表示的头部</strong>。多列一个高基数头部（如 <code>User-Agent</code> 全量值）就会把缓存成倍碎片化，命中率断崖式下跌。</li>\n<li><strong>同一 URL 的所有响应必须返回一致的 <code>Vary</code></strong>，包括 <code>304 Not Modified</code> 与协商后的默认响应。不一致会让缓存把同一资源反复当作新变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>失效策略由 <code>Cache-Control</code> 指令族表达，其规范基础是三条 RFC：<strong>RFC 9111</strong> 定义核心缓存行为，<strong>RFC 5861</strong> 定义陈旧内容扩展（<code>stale-while-revalidate</code> / <code>stale-if-error</code>），<strong>RFC 8246</strong> 定义 <code>immutable</code>。跨境电商读多写少的目录页最常用的是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"Cache-Control: max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400, stale-if-error=86400\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Cache-Control: max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400, stale-if-error=86400</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按 MDN 的解释，这条响应在 604800 秒（7 天）内新鲜；随后 86400 秒（1 天）内，缓存可以先返回陈旧副本、同时在后台向源站重新验证，用户完全感知不到重验证的时延。<code>stale-if-error</code> 则在上游返回 <strong>500/502/503/504</strong> 时允许继续返回陈旧副本，窗口同样为 1 天（来源：developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Cache-Control）。对促销期源站偶发过载的电商场景，<code>stale-if-error</code> 是一道廉价但有效的降级防线。</p>\n<p>静态资源的版本化 URL 配合长 TTL 是另一条基本规则：内容哈希进文件名后，可以安全地用 <code>Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable</code> 把有效期设到一年，把失效问题转化为「换 URL」而不是「清缓存」。与之相对，必须始终重验证的资源用 <code>no-cache</code>（可存储但每次需重验证），敏感内容用 <code>no-store</code>——注意 <code>no-cache</code> <strong>不等于</strong>「不存储」。</p>\n<p>主动失效（purge）有两类粒度。按 URL 精确清理适合少量既有明确地址的对象；按标签/代理键（surrogate key）批量清理适合「某个 SKU 变了，它出现在 200 个页面和它的图片一起失效」这类事件。电商的库存与价格变更应走标签失效，而不是靠极短 TTL 反复回源。此外，负缓存同样会占用命中率预算：不存在的对象被缓存后，新建的同名对象在一定窗口内可能读不到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘持久化状态的分级\">边缘持久化状态的分级</h2><p>缓存副本之外，边缘还要承载一部分<strong>由边缘自己写入</strong>的状态：购物车草稿、A/B 分桶、限流计数、会话标记。这类数据不能靠 HTTP 缓存语义解决，需要按一致性要求分级存放。Cloudflare Workers KV 是典型的「最终一致、读多写少」设计：KV 写入先落中央存储，再通过 <strong>hybrid push/pull 复制</strong>在访问后缓存到各地数据中心，默认读缓存生命周期 <code>cacheTtl</code> 为 <strong>60 秒</strong>；在写入所在地通常立即可见但不保证，其他位置 <strong>&quot;changes may take up to 60 seconds or more to be visible&quot;</strong>（来源：developers.cloudflare.com/kv/concepts/how-kv-works/）。文档还给出两条限制：负向查询（不存在的键）也会被缓存；KV <strong>不适合原子操作或单事务读写</strong>，需要更强一致性时推荐改用 Durable Objects。</p>\n<p>据此得到一张边缘状态的选型表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>一致性需求</th>\n<th>建议存放</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品目录快照、配置</td>\n<td>最终一致可接受</td>\n<td>边缘 KV / HTTP 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流计数、库存预占</td>\n<td>强一致、需原子</td>\n<td>Durable Object / 边缘事务 DB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话与登录态</td>\n<td>中等，需低延迟</td>\n<td>边缘 KV + 短 TTL，权威回中心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单与支付</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>中心数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的分界线是「错了会怎样」：商品图多显示 60 秒旧版本没有后果，库存超卖一次就是真金白银的损失。把强一致需求硬塞进最终一致存储，是边缘状态最常见的架构错误。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>该把哪种状态放在离用户多近、节点选址如何权衡时延与一致性半径，属于放置调度的职责，见同 hub 的《<a href=\"../2_near-user-compute-scheduling/1_latency-aware-placement-model.md\"></a>时延感知的放置模型》。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"存储分层与生命周期\">存储分层与生命周期</h2><p>边缘节点的本地 NVMe 时延以微秒计但每 GB 成本最高；对象存储容量近乎无限但检索与出口要计费。总拥有成本可写成三项之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{total} = C_{storage} + C_{retrieval} + C_{egress}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>类型化对象存储把这三个变量拉开成多个档位。以 AWS S3 为例（来源：aws.amazon.com/s3/storage-classes/）：高频访问用 S3 Standard；访问模式不可预测时用 S3 Intelligent-Tiering，由系统按访问行为自动在层间迁移；访问不频繁但需毫秒级取回时用 S3 Standard-IA；可忍受分钟到小时级取回时下沉到 Glacier 系列。判据不是「数据重不重要」，而是「多久访问一次、能容忍多长的取回时间」。</p>\n<p>生命周期策略（lifecycle policy）把这一选择自动化：规则可基于对象年龄或标签，把对象在创建后第 N 天转档、第 M 天过期删除。对跨境电商，典型的落点是：商品主图长 TTL 缓存于边缘、源对象留在 Standard/Standard-IA；历史订单附件与对账文件创建后 30 天转 IA、90 天转 Glacier 档；临时导出与日志设明确过期时间，避免无限累积。</p>\n<p>一个反复出现的反模式是把「缓存」当成「分层存储」：在边缘节点用 LRU 驱逐控制容量，却忘了被驱逐的对象下次仍要回源，且回源本身有出口成本。正确的分层是——边缘缓存用 TTL 与驱逐策略控制<em>时延</em>，后端存储用生命周期策略控制<em>成本</em>，两者用同一份标签/键体系关联，让一次失效同时清理两层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分层缓存的价值在收敛回源：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{origin} \\approx \\lambda_{total}(1-H_{edge})(1-H_{tier})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，Cloudflare Tiered Cache 与 CloudFront Origin Shield 都把「回源权限」收窄到单一上层。</li>\n<li>Origin Shield 的关键机制是请求折叠，能把同一未命中对象的并发回源压到「as few as one」；同时注意同区域旁路与 TTL&lt;3600 秒按动态计费的规则。</li>\n<li>缓存键由方法、URL 和 <code>Vary</code> 共同决定；高基数 <code>Vary</code> 会碎片化缓存，同一 URL 的所有响应必须返回一致的 <code>Vary</code>。</li>\n<li>失效策略以 RFC 9111 / 5861 / 8246 为规范基础；<code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 与 <code>stale-if-error</code> 是应对源站抖动与后台刷新的主力指令。</li>\n<li>边缘状态需按一致性分级：读多写少走 KV（默认 <code>cacheTtl</code> 60 秒、最终一致），需要原子性时走 Durable Object。</li>\n<li>存储分层用生命周期策略按访问频率与取回容忍度迁移成本档位；不要把 LRU 缓存当作分层存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘缓存与分层存储工程","id":"边缘缓存与分层存储工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分层缓存拓扑与回源收敛","id":"分层缓存拓扑与回源收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存键、变体与失效策略","id":"缓存键-变体与失效策略"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘持久化状态的分级","id":"边缘持久化状态的分级"},{"level":2,"text":"存储分层与生命周期","id":"存储分层与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘状态一致性与本地优先数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-data-and-state/edge-state-consistency-model"},"next":{"title":"多站点数据同步与数据驻留合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-data-and-state/multi-site-sync-data-residency"}}